 "remarks": "Welcome to this renovated 2-bedroom, 1 bath rental in Shippan. This unit sports a gourmet kitchen featuring stainless steel appliances, granite countertops, and a stylish tile backsplash. Located just minutes from Shippan's beaches, Harbor Point, i-95, the train station, and Downtown Stamford, this residence provides the perfect blend of convenience and leisure. Additional perks include washer/dryer, dedicated storage unit in basement, and reserved off-street parking for 2 cars. Tenant responsible for electric and natural gas. Credit check, application are a must. 2 months security deposit.",
